WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:16.840
Little John liked living with the Sheriff of Nottingham.

2
00:00:18.721 --> 00:00:22.863
He sat near the sheriff at meals and ate rich and delicious food.

3
00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:28.586
During the cold winter, he slept in a warm room with a blazing fire.

4
00:00:30.247 --> 00:00:32.328
Little John grew fat and happy.

5
00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:37.469
He thought about returning to Robin Hood, but six months slipped away.

6
00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:42.711
The sheriff enjoyed having Little John in his household.

7
00:00:43.751 --> 00:00:47.032
He still thought Little John's name was Reynold Greenleaf.

8
00:00:48.073 --> 00:00:50.613
He didn't know that Little John was one of Robin's men.

9
00:00:52.754 --> 00:00:55.655
One morning life at the sheriff's house changed.

10
00:00:56.715 --> 00:00:58.656
The sheriff and his men went hunting.

11
00:00:59.836 --> 00:01:04.039
Little John was supposed to go too, but he was still sleeping when everyone left.

12
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:10.103
After he finally opened his eyes, he heard the sound of a distant horn.

13
00:01:10.123 --> 00:01:15.006
"That reminds me of Robin's horn," murmured Little John.

14
00:01:16.067 --> 00:01:19.950
He began to think of his friends in Sherwood Forest and wonder what they were doing.

15
00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:24.573
"Oh, I miss them and the woods!"

16
00:01:24.973 --> 00:01:26.254
Little John said aloud.

17
00:01:26.274 --> 00:01:28.696
"I'm going back there today!"

18
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:33.961
Little John got dressed and went downstairs for one last breakfast.

19
00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:37.022
The sheriff's property manager was in the kitchen.

20
00:01:38.002 --> 00:01:40.723
The property manager was a huge, fat man.

21
00:01:41.543 --> 00:01:43.744
A bundle of keys hung from his belt.

22
00:01:43.764 --> 00:01:46.744
"What's for breakfast?"

23
00:01:47.345 --> 00:01:49.005
asked Little John, sitting down.

24
00:01:49.025 --> 00:01:51.306
"I'm hungry this morning."

25
00:01:52.086 --> 00:01:56.827
The manager hated Little John because he was the sheriff's favorite servant.

26
00:01:57.587 --> 00:02:00.360
"Breakfast is over, Reynold.

27
00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:03.002
If you want something to eat, there's food in the pantry."

28
00:02:03.602 --> 00:02:04.923
Little John scowled.

29
00:02:04.943 --> 00:02:06.904
"Then bring it here."

30
00:02:06.924 --> 00:02:09.605
"Get it yourself!"

31
00:02:10.106 --> 00:02:11.026
snapped the manager.

32
00:02:11.046 --> 00:02:12.907
"I'm not your servant."

33
00:02:12.927 --> 00:02:15.989
"I told you to bring it to me!"

34
00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:17.209
said Little John.

35
00:02:17.229 --> 00:02:19.231
"And I said, get it yourself."

36
00:02:19.251 --> 00:02:21.552
"Fine! I'll do that!"

37
00:02:22.252 --> 00:02:25.454
Little John stood up and stomped over to the pantry.

38
00:02:26.254 --> 00:02:28.536
He tried to open the door, but it was locked.

39
00:02:30.604 --> 00:02:33.066
The manager laughed and shook his keys.

40
00:02:33.086 --> 00:02:36.588
"Too bad you don't have a key!"

41
00:02:37.229 --> 00:02:40.011
This teasing was too much for Little John.

42
00:02:40.691 --> 00:02:43.093
He punched a large hole in the door!

43
00:02:43.613 --> 00:02:47.696
Then he stuck his head through the hole and started to enter the pantry.

44
00:02:48.356 --> 00:02:50.318
The manager grabbed Little John.

45
00:02:50.918 --> 00:02:53.159
He punched him and hit him with his keys.

46
00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:59.424
Filled with rage, Little John hit the manager so hard, he knocked the man out!

47
00:03:00.552 --> 00:03:02.214
"Now I can eat breakfast!"

48
00:03:03.034 --> 00:03:04.716
Little John entered the pantry.

49
00:03:06.437 --> 00:03:10.160
He saw two meat pies, a roasted chicken, and a platter of eggs.

50
00:03:11.261 --> 00:03:15.805
Little John placed the food on a table and sat down to begin his meal.

51
00:03:16.806 --> 00:03:20.169
Meanwhile the cook had heard Little John and the manager arguing.

52
00:03:20.869 --> 00:03:21.930
He came running.

53
00:03:22.511 --> 00:03:24.733
The manager was just sitting up.

54
00:03:24.753 --> 00:03:27.295
"What happened?"

55
00:03:27.675 --> 00:03:28.436
the cook asked.

56
00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:32.023
"Reynold Greenleaf broke into our master's pantry.

57
00:03:33.464 --> 00:03:35.386
When I tried to stop him, he almost killed me!"

58
00:03:35.886 --> 00:03:38.449
The manager knew that the cook liked to fight.

59
00:03:38.469 --> 00:03:40.170
"You're a strong guy.

60
00:03:40.651 --> 00:03:43.153
I'll give you five gold coins if you get rid of him."

61
00:03:43.173 --> 00:03:47.417
"No problem," the cook replied.

62
00:03:47.437 --> 00:03:49.159
"I'll take care of him.

63
00:03:49.759 --> 00:03:50.920
Go to your room and rest."

64
00:03:51.721 --> 00:03:54.504
The cook reached for his sword and entered the pantry.

65
00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:59.002
Little John was tucking his napkin under his chin, ready to eat.

66
00:03:59.022 --> 00:04:01.964
"Reynold Greenleaf!"

67
00:04:02.444 --> 00:04:03.184
shouted the cook.

68
00:04:03.825 --> 00:04:05.206
He waved his sword.

69
00:04:05.226 --> 00:04:07.987
"Stop eating, you thief!"

70
00:04:09.028 --> 00:04:11.869
Little John put down his fork and got his sword.

71
00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:14.971
He was ready to fight.

72
00:04:16.111 --> 00:04:18.273
But suddenly he lowered his weapon.

73
00:04:18.293 --> 00:04:21.654
"There's some mighty good food here, Cook.

74
00:04:22.535 --> 00:04:24.156
It would be a shame to waste it.

75
00:04:24.844 --> 00:04:27.385
Why don't we enjoy a meal together first?"

76
00:04:28.925 --> 00:04:32.086
"Hmm The cook didn't know what to do.

77
00:04:32.826 --> 00:04:36.407
He wanted the manager's reward, but he also liked to eat.

78
00:04:37.307 --> 00:04:40.528
Finally he took a deep breath and put away his sword.

79
00:04:40.548 --> 00:04:42.449
"You're right.

80
00:04:43.049 --> 00:04:44.789
We should eat before we fight.

81
00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.590
We need to keep up our strength."

82
00:04:49.851 --> 00:04:53.732
So the two men sat down and ate a hearty meal together.

83
00:04:54.572 --> 00:04:56.293
They sang and ate some more.

84
00:05:01.976 --> 00:05:03.817
At last they were ready to fight.

85
00:05:05.378 --> 00:05:06.899
For an hour they battled.

86
00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:10.861
They fought in the kitchen and up and down the hall.

87
00:05:11.922 --> 00:05:15.064
They fought until they were too tired to move.

88
00:05:15.084 --> 00:05:20.627
"Whew. Let's take a break," Little John said, panting.

89
00:05:23.048 --> 00:05:25.550
"I can't even remember why we're fighting."

90
00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:30.634
"Neither can I," said the cook.

91
00:05:31.634 --> 00:05:34.797
"I don't even like the property manager very much."

92
00:05:34.817 --> 00:05:41.542
"Well, I certainly admire you," added Little John.

93
00:05:41.562 --> 00:05:44.584
"Few men fight as well as you do.

94
00:05:45.344 --> 00:05:48.026
I'm returning to Robin Hood and his band today.

95
00:05:48.807 --> 00:05:50.148
How about joining us?

96
00:05:51.284 --> 00:05:55.430
You would have a wonderful life in Sherwood Forest among many friends."

97
00:05:56.211 --> 00:06:00.417
The cook dropped his sword and stared at Little John in surprise.

98
00:06:00.437 --> 00:06:03.001
"Who are you?"

99
00:06:03.582 --> 00:06:04.202
he cried.
